# Production build of the dashboard ships the synthetic demo dataset.
#
# WHY: the real observations behind the FastAPI API stop at 2022 and cover
# only 5 crops (Bajra, Barley, Potato, Rice, Wheat) x 22 districts = 162 rows.
# The demo generator covers 2021-2025 x 17 crops (~15,000 rows), which is
# what the dashboard is designed to show. Flip this to "live" (or delete the
# file) once the dataset has observed/predicted yields for 2023-2025 and the
# remaining crops; see README.md ("Deployment -> Data mode").
VITE_DATA_MODE=demo
